first lap the order was Stuck, Varzi, Nuvolari, Caracciola, Fagioli, Straight, Leiningen, Chiron, Zehender, Comotti, Momberger, R\u00fcesch, Howe, Trossi und Henne.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":2,"text":"Stuck leads Varzi by five seconds; Caracciola, past Nuvolari, is five more back. Henne retires with a damaged radiator and steering.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":5,"text":"Caracciola overhauls Varzi for second; Stuck laps in 2m13.6s.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":8,"text":"Leiningen, closing fast, passes both Nuvolari and Varzi.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":13,"text":"Fagioli arrives slowly at the pits and retires with an engine problem. Varzi passes Nuvolari; Caracciola is 13 seconds behind Stuck.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":19,"text":"On the19th lap Momberger was able to overtake both Varzi and Nuvolari to climb to fourth place. Now, German cars held the first four places and pushed the Italian cars into mid-field.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":6},{"lap":26,"text":"On the 26th lap Stuck put Chiron one lap down.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":30,"text":"After 30 laps Nuvolari was only a second and a half behind Varzi.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":4},{"lap":36,"text":"Momberger stops with burns and blisters on his foot from the hot brake pedal; Sebastian takes over and rejoins eighth.","q":false,"c":6},{"lap":39,"text":"Nuvolari changes rear tyres and refuels in 1m14s; Sebastian passes him meanwhile.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":42,"text":"Varzi, lapping in 2m21s and 2m22s, is lapped by Stuck.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":47,"text":"On lap 47 Chiron stopped to change a tire and refuel, all in two minutes.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":50,"text":"Stuck's lead over Caracciola, who is in pain from his leg, grows to nearly a minute. Zehender retires after repeated brake stops.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":55,"text":"Leiningen, third, fails to come past the pits: stranded out of fuel, he walks back to report it.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":56,"text":"Sebastian hands the car over to Momberger.","c":6},{"lap":57,"text":"Stuck refuels and changes all four wheels in 2m53s; Caracciola takes the lead.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":59,"text":"Caracciola stops to refuel, exhausted and with an injured arm; Fagioli takes over and leaves after 2m12s, 15 seconds ahead of Stuck.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":60,"text":"R\u00fcesch runs out of fuel on the straight; his reserve Sandri brings him a can, against the rules.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":74,"text":"Stuck, his foot burned by the hot pedal, hands over to Leiningen; the restart takes 2m30s and the car drops to fourth behind Varzi and Trossi.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":77,"text":"Momberger hands the car over to Sebastian.","c":6},{"lap":80,"text":"Comotti's overfilled tank catches fire in the pits; the flames are put out and Marinoni replaces the unconscious Comotti.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":86,"text":"Leiningen takes third from Trossi.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":92,"text":"On lap 92 Varzi, who was holding second place, stopped at his pit.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":95,"text":"Stuck, his feet bandaged and in borrowed shoes, takes the wheel back from Leiningen.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":95,"text":"Varzi hands the car over to Tadini.","c":10},{"lap":97,"text":"Tadini, in Varzi's car, retires with a defective gearbox.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":99,"text":"Trossi hands over to Comotti during a 1m05s fuel stop; Stuck passes into second.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":99,"text":"Trossi hands the car over to Comotti.","c":2},{"lap":116,"text":"Fagioli wins in Caracciola's Mercedes after 4h45m47s; Stuck is second, Trossi/Comotti third.","q":false,"c":0}]}